    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2051998970608849338",
      "url": "https://x.com/QCGov/status/2051998970608849338",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/QCGov/status/2051998970608849338",
      "text": "Summer na, galaw na tayo, QCitizens! 🏊‍♂️⚽️🛹\n\nNgayong bakasyon, hatid ng Quezon City ang Bakasyong Sulit: QC Summer Activities for Youth and Children—na may libreng activities tulad ng swimming, football, at skateboarding! 🌞✨\n\nMatuto ng bagong skills, mag-build ng confidence, at makahanap ng bagong barkada habang active at healthy ngayong summer. 💪\n\nBawas muna sa screen time at doomscrolling—oras na para gumalaw, matuto, at magsaya! 📵\n\nMag-register sa link na ito: https://t.co/bbPB7mQnTF\n\n📌 Reminders:\n• Activities are age-specific—please check eligibility per program\n• Limited slots only\n• Strictly no walk-ins—for registered participants only\n• Submission of the form does not guarantee a slot (wait for confirmation)\n\nKitakits sa pools, fields, at skate areas, QCitizens! 🙌\n\nPara sa registration at inquiries, maaaring makipag-ugnayan sa:\n\nOffice of the City Administrator – QC Sports\n📞 89223227\n\n📍 Para sa activities sa Amoranto:\n📞 8374-2593\n📱 0917-1373563 / 0960-4162094\n\nTingnan ang iba pang summer activities na maaari ninyong salihan dito:\n\nQuezon City Public Library: https://t.co/90aicfPLeD\n\nQC Tourism Department: https://t.co/j13f9UmoqQ\n\nQuezon City Sports Development Office: https://t.co/VVMBIFNdwC\n\nAll aboard Expo 2026: https://t.co/Lfz65TWTpj\n\nQuezon City Fire District: https://t.co/fPG1Rl8PmG\n\nRosario Maclang Bautista General Hospital (RMBGH): https://t.co/M27vH5ZWtk\n\nQuezon City Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Office: https://t.co/CpiAIbKHcJ\n\n#QCSummerActivities2026",
